application.submitted.applicant.email_body:
Dear {{applicant_name}},

We are writing to confirm receipt of the application submitted on behalf of {{company_name}} for authorisation as {{license_type}}. The application was submitted on {{submitted_at}} and has been recorded under reference {{application_number}}.

Application particulars
Sector: {{sector_name}}{{#sub_sector_name}}
Sub-sector: {{sub_sector_name}}{{/sub_sector_name}}{{#category_name}}
Category: {{category_name}}{{/category_name}}

The application will first be reviewed for completeness against the applicable licensing requirements. If any document or particular is outstanding, the Authority will issue a formal information request through the Regulatory Portal.

No action is required from you at this time. Please quote {{application_number}} in any communication with the Authority concerning this matter.

What happens next
Following the completeness review, the application will be allocated for assessment. You will be notified of any further requirements, and of the determination, through the Regulatory Portal and by email.

Regards,
{{app_name}}

application.resubmitted.applicant.email_body:
Dear {{applicant_name}},

We are writing to confirm that your resubmission of application {{application_number}}, submitted on behalf of {{company_name}} for authorisation as {{license_type}}, was received on {{resubmitted_at}}.

Application particulars
Sector: {{sector_name}}{{#sub_sector_name}}
Sub-sector: {{sub_sector_name}}{{/sub_sector_name}}{{#category_name}}
Category: {{category_name}}{{/category_name}}{{#current_workflow_step}}
Current assessment stage: {{current_workflow_step}}{{/current_workflow_step}}

The resubmitted application will be reviewed to confirm that the matters previously raised have been addressed. Should any item remain outstanding, a further request will be issued through the Regulatory Portal.

No action is required from you at this time.

What happens next
The Authority will resume its assessment and will notify you of any further requirements, or of the determination, in due course.

Regards,
{{app_name}}
